# W7 STATUS: NOT WON -- faithful income/build-time changes (wave 7). The
# opening works (LCRF beaching needs the w7r1 transport sub-cell fix), the base
# and the Chrono Miner run, but one miner now earns ~1/4 of before (it drives
# back to the ore), the Grizzly has BuildTimeMultiplier=1.5, and Tesla
# Troopers / V3 fire take the ore field and the barracks (~f5400, at Normal and
# Easy alike); the army never reaches 15 Grizzlies (3 at f16578) and the run
# ends RUNNING at ~f30000. Needs a new strategy, not a timing re-tune.
# P1: ALL04 (Chicago) won with real orders only (no cheats).
# W4-SQ-01/02 opening: the landing craft arrive CARRYING the MCV and the
# tank/GI groups (TeamType Full=yes); Soviet garrison teams occupy civilian
# buildings (script 46 type arg). The player beaches the MCV craft, unloads it
# with the Deploy key and deploys the MCV ('ConYdBuilt' hands PlayerAlt2's
# landed Grizzlies/GIs over). Then a base from the sidebar and a Grizzly/IFV
# army that destroys the Psychic Amplifier before the 50-minute timer.
# MR1 (after L0's frame timers: the Russian assault on the base now comes at
# ~f7000 and the old 12-Grizzly army left the Amplifier at 181/1000 HP): two
# more war factories are built WHILE the Grizzlies train (MultipleFactory
# 0.8 -> x1.25, x1.5625), so 15 are out by ~f6700 and take it.
# Generated by scripts/play/gen/mk_all04.py -- edit the generator.
